    "updated_at": "2025-02-07T19:53:18Z",
    "body": "Provided there's no unexpected behaviour (such as the dialog being added to the *list* (set in chrome so might not be noticed) twice when calling show() and showModal()) I think that's preferable. Would solve the initially open case too.\n\nFor the sake of completeness I think it should match `:open` too. I know that's not a spec concern but it would be good to add a WPT to ensure it's synced to the attribute correctly. (Likewise when removing the open attribute)",
